# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  KOA project .gitignore  — keeps datasets, weights & secrets
#  out of GitHub. Only code + notebooks get pushed.
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Dataset folders (thousands of images — never commit) ───
kaggle_dataset_2018/
kaggle_dataset2_2020/
graded_dataset_5/
graded_extra_test_2020_E1/
stage1_binary/
stage2_mod_vs_sev/
# catch-all for any other data/image folders
graded_*/
*_dataset*/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg

# ── Model weights (large; live on the Hugging Face Space) ──
*.h5
*.keras
*.ckpt

# ── Secrets: never commit these ────────────────────────────
.env
*.env
secrets.*
*.key

# ── Python / Jupyter junk ──────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# ── Windows / editor junk ──────────────────────────────────
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
ngrok*.exe